Hello [Name],

I=E2=80=99m preparing Rein Protocol Foundation, an independent AI-native NGO =
for the Agent era. We believe AI Agent safety needs broader public participat=
ion. Commercial pressures and intense competition can make it difficult for m=
ajor AI companies to prioritize independent public-interest safety work. Our =
approach is to use AI Agents to analyze and oversee AI Agents.

Agents developed by the early team are intended to run the organization=E2=80=
=99s day-to-day work autonomously, including maintaining communities and free=
 online resources, coordinating in-person events, and reporting progress. Peo=
ple remain accountable for the mission and legal duties.

We plan free online AI learning resources, in-person events at universities a=
nd business venues, and support for AI Agent Safety research. Events will bri=
ng researchers, investors, startup founders and people from other sectors tog=
ether, helping more people explore a path into AI Agent development.

Would this be of interest to you? I=E2=80=99d value your view on Rein Protoco=
l Foundation and what support might fit, such as feedback on research, joinin=
g a discussion, or an introduction. Could we schedule a quick 15-minute talk?

Explore the Rein community: https://rein-protocol.org

Best,
[Name]
[Contact]

Rein Protocol Foundation is in preparation. The Agents and programs described=
 are planned work.

